  "Control Systems — SCADA / DCS / PLC": "أنظمة التحكم – SCADA / DCS / PLC",
  "PLC panel build and programming, SCADA configuration and HMI development.": "بناء وبرمجة لوحة PLC وتكوين SCADA وتطوير HMI.",
